            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "cpt.rt_icv"
          },
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "cpt.d_prime"
          }
        ]
      },
      "kind": "independent_summary",
      "text": "d′ 描述目标辨别，反应时变异系数描述正确命中时反应速度的波动；变异系数没有 0–1 上限，也不是能力百分比。",
      "evidenceKeys": [
        "cpt.rt_icv",
        "cpt.d_prime"
      ],
      "supportRefs": []
